  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In extension to the existing avatar whitelist for showing or hiding avatars in full, there needs to be an option to select individual aspects of avatars to view or not. In a specific use case for one of my avatars, I only need other users to see my custom animations, but nothing else.\n\nThis is beneficial for a multitude of reasons. One reason is trusting random users. If I can enable a very specific thing for another user, there's less of a chance that something completely malicious could be done. This is also beneficial in that it's easier to get random people to enable a specific attribute for your avatar, especially if you are someone in good standing. Certain people may not be comfortable with giving full access to random avatars, but allowing specific attributes would be much easier and lightweight.",
